aerographene: barra de favoritos não mostra a pasta dos pinned.

Origem: aerographene (original). Licença: GPL-3.0.
Propósito: SCOPE item 4. A pasta de pinned do PinnedModel (meta info
`aerographene.pinned=1`, F4a) fica na barra de favoritos do perfil; a barra e
seus menus passam a ignorá-la. chrome://bookmarks continua mostrando.
Arquivos: chrome/browser/ui/views/bookmarks/bookmark_bar_view.cc e
bookmark_menu_delegate.cc. Função local `IsPinnedFolder` com a chave literal
(sem dependência do alvo tabs).

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/views/bookmarks/bookmark_bar_view.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/views/bookmarks/bookmark_bar_view.cc
@@ -295,6 +295,16 @@ std::vector<raw_ptr<const BookmarkNode, VectorExperimental>> ToRawPtrVector(
     return raw_ptr<const BookmarkNode, VectorExperimental>(node);
   });
 }
+
+// aerographene: the folder that holds the pinned tabs of the space lives on
+// the bookmark bar, but the bar must not show it. Key is
+// aerographene::kPinnedMetaKey (pinned_model.h), duplicated to avoid a
+// dependency from views/bookmarks on ui/tabs.
+bool IsPinnedFolder(const BookmarkNode* node) {
+  std::string value;
+  return node->is_folder() &&
+         node->GetMetaInfo("aerographene.pinned", &value) && value == "1";
+}
